{"product_id":"drop-s","title":"Drop S","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop S is a stylish outdoor spa that combines the minimalist design of the Drop pool with modern outdoor spa technology. Drop S outdoor spa pool is designed and made in Finland and guarantees a first-class bathing experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The pool has massage seats for four and fits up to eight bathers at the same time. Drop S has 6” massage nozzles that guarantee just the right amount of relaxing water flow.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e The electrically-heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8; massage seats for 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  +\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eContents of the pool package\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey, or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 pc of 6″ massage nozzles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump \u003cspan class=\"JsGRdQ\"\u003e1,1 kW\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eDigital control panel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"sisalto\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553770139972,"sku":"301130508","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095113028,"sku":"301130509","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553770172740,"sku":"301130208","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095145796,"sku":"301130209","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553770205508,"sku":"301130408","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":47717095211332,"sku":"301130409","price":15600.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offe